{"title": "Trigonometric Identities (Level 3)", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>If tan&#952; = 3/5, then find the value of (1 + sec&#952;)(1  -  sec&#952;)/(1 + cosec&#952;)(1  -  cosec&#952;).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; tan&#952; = 3/5, &#2340;&#2379; (1 + sec&#952;)(1 - sec&#952;)/(1 + cosec&#952;)(1 - cosec&#952;) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["9/25", "25/9", "81/625", "625/81"], "options_hi": ["9/25", "25/9", "81/625", "625/81"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>tan&#952; = 3/5</p><p>(1 + sec&#952;)(1  -  sec&#952;)/(1 + cosec&#952;)(1  -  cosec&#952;)</p><p>= (sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  1)/(cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  1)</p><p>= tan<sup>2</sup>&#952;/cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>= tan<sup>4</sup>&#952;</p><p>= (3/5)<sup>4</sup></p><p>= 81/625</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>tan&#952; = 3/5</p><p>(1 + sec&#952;)(1  -  sec&#952;)/(1 + cosec&#952;)(1  -  cosec&#952;)</p><p>= (sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  1)/(cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  1)</p><p>= tan<sup>2</sup>&#952;/cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>= tan<sup>4</sup>&#952;</p><p>= (3/5)<sup>4</sup></p><p>= 81/625</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The minimum value of 2 sin<sup>2</sup> q + 3 cos<sup>2</sup> q is </p>", "q_hi": "<p>2 sin<sup>2</sup> q + 3 cos<sup>2</sup> q &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344;&#2340;&#2350; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376; -</p>", "options_en": ["0", "3", "2", "1"], "options_hi": ["0", "3", "2", "1"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": " <p>2 sin<sup>2</sup> q + 3 cos<sup>2</sup> q</p> <p>= 2(sin<sup>2</sup> q + cos<sup>2</sup> q) + cos<sup>2</sup> q</p> <p>= 2 + cos<sup>2</sup> q</p> <p>Since the minimum value of cos<sup>2</sup> q is 0, the minimum value of the given expression is 2.</p>", "solution_hi": " <p>2 sin<sup>2</sup> q + 3 cos<sup>2</sup> q</p> <p>= 2(sin<sup>2</sup> q + cos<sup>2</sup> q) + cos<sup>2</sup> q</p> <p>= 2 + cos<sup>2</sup> q</p> <p>Since the minimum value of cos<sup>2</sup> q is 0, the minimum value of the given expression is 2.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If cos<sup>2</sup> &theta; + 12.5 sin &theta; - 7 = 0, then the value of sin &theta; is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cos<sup>2</sup> &#952; + 12.5 sin &#952; - 7 = 0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; sin &#952; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:____</p>", "options_en": ["-&frac12;", "&frac12;", "5", "1/&radic;2"], "options_hi": ["-&frac12;", "&frac12;", "5", "1/&radic;2"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>cos<sup>2</sup> &theta; + 12.5 sin &theta; - 7 = 0</p><p>1 - sin<sup>2</sup>&theta; + 12.5 sin &theta; - 7 = 0</p><p>Multiplying by 2 on both sides,</p><p>=&gt; 2-2sin<sup>2</sup> &theta;+ 25sin &theta;-14 = 0</p> <p>=&gt; 2 sin<sup>2</sup> &theta; -25 sin &theta; +12 = 0</p> <p>=&gt; (2sin &theta; - 1) (sin &theta; - 12) = 0</p> <p>=&gt; 2sin &theta; = 1 (Since sin &theta; cant be 12, as its maximum value is 1)</p> <p>=&gt; sin &theta; = &frac12; </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cos<sup>2</sup> &theta; + 12.5 sin &theta; - 7 = 0</p><p>1 - sin<sup>2</sup>&theta; + 12.5 sin &theta; - 7 = 0</p><p>Multiplying by 2 on both sides,</p><p>=&gt; 2-2sin<sup>2</sup> &theta;+ 25sin &theta;-14 = 0</p> <p>=&gt; 2 sin<sup>2</sup> &theta; -25 sin &theta; +12 = 0</p> <p>=&gt; (2sin &theta; - 1) (sin &theta; - 12) = 0</p> <p>=&gt; 2sin &theta; = 1 (Since sin &theta; cant be 12, as its maximum value is 1)</p> <p>=&gt; sin &theta; = &frac12; </p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the value of (cosA + cosB)<sup>2</sup> + (sinA  -  sinB)<sup>2</sup>?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>(cosA + cosB)<sup>2</sup> + (sinA - sinB)<sup>2</sup>? &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; ?</p>", "options_en": ["4cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)", "2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2", "2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)", "4cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2"], "options_hi": ["4cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)", "2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2", "2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2", "4cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>= (cosA + cosB)<sup>2</sup> + (sinA  -  sinB)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (cos<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>B + 2cosA.cosB) + (sin<sup>2</sup>A + sin<sup>2</sup>B  -  2sinA.sinB)</p><p>= (cos<sup>2</sup>A + sin<sup>2</sup>A) + (cos<sup>2</sup>B + sin<sup>2</sup>B) + 2(cosA.cosB  -  sinA.sinB)</p><p>= 1 + 1 + 2cos(A + B)</p><p>= 2[1 + cos(A + B)]</p><p>= 2[1 + 2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2  -  1]</p><p>= 2 * 2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2</p><p>= 4cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>= (cosA + cosB)<sup>2</sup> + (sinA  -  sinB)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (cos<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>B + 2cosA.cosB) + (sin<sup>2</sup>A + sin<sup>2</sup>B  -  2sinA.sinB)</p><p>= (cos<sup>2</sup>A + sin<sup>2</sup>A) + (cos<sup>2</sup>B + sin<sup>2</sup>B) + 2(cosA.cosB  -  sinA.sinB)</p><p>= 1 + 1 + 2cos(A + B)</p><p>= 2[1 + cos(A + B)]</p><p>= 2[1 + 2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2  -  1]</p><p>= 2 * 2cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2</p><p>= 4cos<sup>2</sup>(A + B)/2</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If p = (1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>B) and q = (1  -  Cot<sup>2</sup>B), then the expression [1  -  (p/q)] = ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; p = (1 - Tan<sup>2</sup>B) &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; q = (1 - Cot<sup>2</sup>B) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; [1 - (p/q)] = ? &#2361;&#2376;-</p>", "options_en": ["Sec<sup>2</sup>B + 1", "1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>B", "Sec<sup>2</sup>B", "Tan<sup>2</sup>B"], "options_hi": ["Sec<sup>2</sup>B + 1", "1 - Tan<sup>2</sup>B", "Sec<sup>2</sup>B", "Tan<sup>2</sup>B"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>p = (1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>B) and q = (1  -  Cot<sup>2</sup>B)</p><p>p = (Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/Cos<sup>2</sup>B</p><p>q =  - (Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/ Sin<sup>2</sup>B</p><p>p/q = [(Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/Cos<sup>2</sup>B]/[  - (Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/ Sin<sup>2</sup>B]</p><p>p/q =  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B/ Cos<sup>2</sup>B =  - Tan<sup>2</sup>B</p><p>1  -  (p/q) = 1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>B = Sec<sup>2</sup>B</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>p = (1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>B) and q = (1  -  Cot<sup>2</sup>B)</p><p>p = (Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/Cos<sup>2</sup>B</p><p>q =  - (Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/ Sin<sup>2</sup>B</p><p>p/q = [(Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/Cos<sup>2</sup>B]/[  - (Cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B)/ Sin<sup>2</sup>B]</p><p>p/q =  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>B/ Cos<sup>2</sup>B =  - Tan<sup>2</sup>B</p><p>1  -  (p/q) = 1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>B = Sec<sup>2</sup>B</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If M sinx  -  3 = N cosx and N sinx  -  4 = - M cos x, then M<sup>2</sup> + N<sup>2</sup> equals to  -</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; M sinx - 3 = N cosx &#2324;&#2352; N sinx - 4 = - M cos x &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; M<sup>2</sup> + N<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376; -</p>", "options_en": ["25", "48", "75", "32"], "options_hi": ["25", "48", "75", "32"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Here, M sinx  -  3 = N cosx</p><p>M sinx  -  N cosx = 3 ..(i)</p><p>And, N sinx  -  4 = - M cos x</p><p>N sinx + M cosx = 4 ..(ii)</p><p>Taking sinx (i) + cosx (ii), we get</p><p>M sin<sup>2</sup>x  -  N sinx cosx + M cos<sup>2</sup>x + N sinx cosx = 3 sinx + 4 cosx</p><p>M = 3 sinx + 4 cosx</p><p>And, (3 sinx + 4 cosx) sinx  -  N cosx = 3 = 3(cos<sup>2</sup>x + sin<sup>2</sup>x)</p><p>N = - 3 cosx + 4 sinx</p><p>Therefore,M<sup>2</sup> + N<sup>2</sup> = (3 sinx + 4 cosx)<sup>2</sup> + ( -  3 cosx + 4 sinx)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9 sin<sup>2</sup>x + 16 cos<sup>2</sup>x + 24 sinx cosx + 16 sin<sup>2</sup>x + 9 cos<sup>2</sup>x  -  24 sinx cosx</p><p>= 9 + 16</p><p>= <b>25</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, M sinx  -  3 = N cosx</p><p>M sinx  -  N cosx = 3 ..(i)</p><p>And, N sinx  -  4 = - M cos x</p><p>N sinx + M cosx = 4 ..(ii)</p><p>Taking sinx (i) + cosx (ii), we get</p><p>M sin<sup>2</sup>x  -  N sinx cosx + M cos<sup>2</sup>x + N sinx cosx = 3 sinx + 4 cosx</p><p>M = 3 sinx + 4 cosx</p><p>And, (3 sinx + 4 cosx) sinx  -  N cosx = 3 = 3(cos<sup>2</sup>x + sin<sup>2</sup>x)</p><p>N = - 3 cosx + 4 sinx</p><p>Therefore,M<sup>2</sup> + N<sup>2</sup> = (3 sinx + 4 cosx)<sup>2</sup> + ( -  3 cosx + 4 sinx)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9 sin<sup>2</sup>x + 16 cos<sup>2</sup>x + 24 sinx cosx + 16 sin<sup>2</sup>x + 9 cos<sup>2</sup>x  -  24 sinx cosx</p><p>= 9 + 16</p><p>= <b>25</b></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If sin&#952; cot&#952; + tan&#952; cos&#952; = sec&#952;, 0&#730; &lt; x &lt; 90&#730;, then (4 cot&#952; + 3 sin&#952;) = k(3 tan &#952;  -  &radic;2 cos &#952;). Find the value of 'k'.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sin&#952; cot&#952; + tan&#952; cos&#952; = sec&#952;, 0&#730; &lt; x &lt; 90&#730; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (4 cot&#952; + 3 sin&#952;) = k(3 tan &#952; - &radic;2 cos &#952;) &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 'k' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["(4 + &radic;2)/3", "(8 + 3&radic;2)/4", "(3&radic;2  -  1)/2", "2(2&radic;2 + 1)/3"], "options_hi": ["(4 + &radic;2)/3", "(8 + 3&radic;2)/4", "(3&radic;2 - 1)/2", "2(2&radic;2 + 1)/3"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Here, sin&#952; cot&#952; + tan&#952; cos&#952; = sec&#952;</p><p>sin&#952; cos&#952;/sin&#952; + (sin&#952;/cos&#952;) cos&#952; = 1/cos&#952;</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>&#952; + sin&#952; cos&#952; = 1</p><p>sin&#952; cos&#952; = 1  -  cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>sin&#952; cos&#952; = sin<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>tan&#952; = 1, then &#952; = 45&#730;</p><p>Therefore, (4 cot&#952; + 3 sin&#952;) = k(3 tan &#952;  -  &radic;2 cos &#952;)</p><p>(4 cot45&#730; + 3 sin45&#730;) = k(3 tan 45&#730;  -  &radic;2 cos 45&#730;)</p><p>(4 * 1 + 3 * 1/&radic;2) = k(3 * 1  -  &radic;2 * 1/&radic;2)</p><p><b>k = (8 + 3</b><b>&radic;</b><b>2)/4</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, sin&#952; cot&#952; + tan&#952; cos&#952; = sec&#952;</p><p>sin&#952; cos&#952;/sin&#952; + (sin&#952;/cos&#952;) cos&#952; = 1/cos&#952;</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>&#952; + sin&#952; cos&#952; = 1</p><p>sin&#952; cos&#952; = 1  -  cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>sin&#952; cos&#952; = sin<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>tan&#952; = 1, then &#952; = 45&#730;</p><p>Therefore, (4 cot&#952; + 3 sin&#952;) = k(3 tan &#952;  -  &radic;2 cos &#952;)</p><p>(4 cot45&#730; + 3 sin45&#730;) = k(3 tan 45&#730;  -  &radic;2 cos 45&#730;)</p><p>(4 * 1 + 3 * 1/&radic;2) = k(3 * 1  -  &radic;2 * 1/&radic;2)</p><p><b>k = (8 + 3</b><b>&radic;</b><b>2)/4</b></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If ((9/2)sin2A/cosA)  -  6cos<sup>2</sup>A = 9, and 0&#730; &lt; x &le; 90&#730; then which of the following is true?</p><p>I. cos2A  -  cosec A + 2 = 0</p><p>II. tan(A/2) = &radic;3</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; ((9/2)sin2A/cosA) - 6cos<sup>2</sup>A = 9 &#2324;&#2352; 0&#730; &lt; x &le; 90&#730; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>I. cos2A - cosec A + 2 = 0</p><p>II. tan(A/2) = &radic;3</p>", "options_en": ["Neither I nor II", "Only II", "Both I and II", "Only I"], "options_hi": ["&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II", "&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II", "I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306;", "&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Here, ((9/2)sin2A/cosA)  -  6cos<sup>2</sup>A = 9</p><p>(9 sinA cosA/cosA)  -  6 + 6sin<sup>2</sup>A = 9</p><p>9sinA + 6sin<sup>2</sup>A  -  15 = 0</p><p>2sin<sup>2</sup>A + 3sinA  -  5 = 0</p><p>2sin<sup>2</sup>A + 5sinA  -  2sinA  -  5 = 0</p><p>(sinA  -  1)(2sinA + 5) = 0</p><p>Then, sin A = 1, A = 90&#730;</p><p>Now, cos2A  -  cosec A + 2 = cos(2 * 90&#730;)  -  cosec 90&#730; + 2 = -1  -  1 + 2 = 0</p><p>So, I is true.</p><p>And, tan(A/2) = tan(90&#730;/2) = tan 45&#730; = 1 &#8800; &radic;3</p><p>So, II is false.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, ((9/2)sin2A/cosA)  -  6cos<sup>2</sup>A = 9</p><p>(9 sinA cosA/cosA)  -  6 + 6sin<sup>2</sup>A = 9</p><p>9sinA + 6sin<sup>2</sup>A  -  15 = 0</p><p>2sin<sup>2</sup>A + 3sinA  -  5 = 0</p><p>2sin<sup>2</sup>A + 5sinA  -  2sinA  -  5 = 0</p><p>(sinA  -  1)(2sinA + 5) = 0</p><p>Then, sin A = 1, A = 90&#730;</p><p>Now, cos2A  -  cosec A + 2 = cos(2 * 90&#730;)  -  cosec 90&#730; + 2 = -1  -  1 + 2 = 0</p><p>So, I is true.</p><p>And, tan(A/2) = tan(90&#730;/2) = tan 45&#730; = 1 &#8800; &radic;3</p><p>So, II is false.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<div>&nbsp;The value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">6(sec<sup>2</sup>72 - cot<sup>2</sup>18) - [sin<sup>2</sup>(53 + &theta;) + sin<sup>2</sup>(37 - &theta;)]</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">cosec(66 + &theta;) + 7cosec<sup>2</sup>46 + 3tan72tan18 - 7tan<sup>2</sup>44 - sec(24 - &theta;)</span></div>&nbsp;is equal to &#58;&nbsp;</div>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;: <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">6(sec<sup>2</sup>72 - cot<sup>2</sup>18) - [sin<sup>2</sup>(53 + &theta;) + sin<sup>2</sup>(37 - &theta;)]</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">cosec(66 + &theta;) + 7cosec<sup>2</sup>46 + 3tan72tan18 - 7tan<sup>2</sup>44 - sec(24 - &theta;)</span></div></div></p>", "options_en": ["2/3", "1/3", "1/2", "1"], "options_hi": ["2/3", "1/3", "1/2", "1"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=480 height=205 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18681/image011.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=480 height=205 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18681/image011.png\"></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>For what value of A, will the below equation equate to 1?</p><p><table style=\"border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black;padding:5px;text-align:center\"><div>&nbsp;4[(sec<sup>4</sup> A + tan<sup>4</sup> A) -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2 sin<sup>2</sup> A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">cos<sup>4</sup> A</span></div>&nbsp;]&nbsp;</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">sin<sup>2</sup> A + 2 sin A + 1</td></tr></table></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p>A &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; 1 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p><table style=\"border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black;padding:5px;text-align:center\"><div>&nbsp;4[(sec<sup>4</sup> A + tan<sup>4</sup> A) -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2 sin<sup>2</sup> A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; paddin